{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07482","headline":"送杨於陵归宋汴州别业 · 刘长卿","name":"送杨於陵归宋汴州别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"半山溪雨带斜晖，向水残花映客衣。\n旅食嗟余当岁晚，能文似汝少年稀。\n新河柳色千株暗，故国云帆万里归。\n离乱要知君到处，寄书须及鴈南飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07482.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07482","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}